### Test Category Filtering in findAll endpoint
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-threads?category=1&page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

### Test existing category endpoint (alternative)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-threads/category/1?page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

### Test forum filtering
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-threads?forumId=1&page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

### Test without filters (get all threads)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/forum-threads?page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json
